mindmap
  root((Team-ready AI product))
    Who can use it?
      Identity / roles
      Permissions / data boundaries
    How does work run?
      Async work / job queues
      Workers / saved results
    How does it feel faster?
      First useful result / streaming
      Segments / permitted reuse
    What if many people arrive?
      Concurrency / rate limits
      Fair scheduling / scaling
    What if something fails?
      Task state / bounded retries
      Resume / avoid duplicate effects
    How does it keep working?
      Quality checks / alerts
      Cost / releases / recovery
